 ('Selected-model mutation challenge','Mutate future prices and volume after a cutoff. Compare the 24-stump fit, earlier scores, top-three choices and an eligible pre-cutoff ledger.',"import importlib.util\nspec=importlib.util.spec_from_file_location('temporal',r/'tests/test_temporal.py');t=importlib.util.module_from_spec(spec);spec.loader.exec_module(t)\nt.test_future_price_changes_cannot_change_earlier_features_or_ridge_predictions();t.test_future_market_mutation_preserves_selected_stump_fit_scores_and_holdings()\ndisplay_bundle(table(['Challenge','Result'],[['Ridge / earlier features','Pass'],['Selected stump fit / scores / choices / holdings','Pass']]))"),
